        "jsCode": "// Compose the GitHub issue title/body from the pristine markdown.\nconst item = $('Route on Verdict').first().json;\nconst issueTitle = '[Jira ' + (item.issueKey || 'N/A') + '] ' + (item.title || 'Bug report');\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...item,\n    githubIssueTitle: issueTitle,\n    githubIssueBody: item.pristine_markdown\n  }\n}];"
